# outputs/ is BUILT from research/*.md by the scripts below — 74MB of PDF, DOCX
# and page renders. The builders are source and are kept; their output is not.
outputs/*
!outputs/*.py

# Office lock files
~$*

# Finder / iCloud duplicates.
#
# macOS appends " 2" when it resolves a sync collision, and it does this to
# whole trees at once. A `git add -A` then sweeps up a hundred stale copies of
# real source files — which is exactly what happened in 4b17392: 108 of them,
# including a `.htaccess 2` that shipped into the website build.
#
# They are never wanted. Ignoring them means the next bulk add cannot repeat it.
* 2
* 2.*
# Finder numbers its copies upwards, so " 3" and beyond arrived after the first
# sweep and one of them ("MarketingHome 3.tsx") got committed.
* [0-9]
* [0-9].*
* [0-9]
* [0-9].*

# Database dumps. Large, and full of every customer record we hold —
# a backup committed to a repository is a breach with a git history.
backups/

# Playwright
test-results/
playwright-report/
